ETS2 DualSense for macOS
Copyright (c) 2026 the ETS2 DualSense for macOS contributors

The controller effects in this project (which effects exist, their thresholds,
timings and intensities) reproduce the behaviour of ETS2_PS5_DualSense by
LikeARealG (https://github.com/LikeARealG/ETS2_PS5_DualSense). This project is
a derived work and is offered under the same terms as that project, reproduced
verbatim below. Credit for the original effect design goes to LikeARealG.

sdk/ contains the SCS Telemetry / Input SDK headers, Copyright (C) 2016 SCS
Software, under the licence in sdk/sdk_license.txt.

